{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26163","headline":"鱼上冰 · 纪元臯","name":"鱼上冰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春生寒气灭，稍动伏泉鱼。\n乍喜东风至，来观曲浦初。\n近冰朱鬣见，望日锦鳞舒。\n渐觉流澌退，还忻掉尾余。\n噞喁情自乐，沿泝意宁疎。\n傥得随鲲化，终能戾太虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"纪元臯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26163.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26163","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}